{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/20700f430d9ff3236ca9d23b39923391.avif?t=1760692872\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Treat or Trick\u2b50&gt; </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hallowanderband</strong> is a <strong>rhythm-action adventure</strong> game driven by Halloween-themed stories.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;The Apprentice Reaper\u2019s Marching Band Begins!&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/bf2d9cb95673165e26bcd117636fe4f4.poster.avif?t=1760692872\" width=1054 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/bf2d9cb95673165e26bcd117636fe4f4.webm?t=1760692872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/bf2d9cb95673165e26bcd117636fe4f4.mp4?t=1760692872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apprentice reaper <strong>Ryoul</strong> is dispatched to <strong>Hallowonderland</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by the Department of the Grim Reapers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But buried under mountains of paperwork, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she decides to chase a long-held dream\u2014joining the <strong>Halloween parade</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of finishing her duties, she sets out to form a marching band: the <strong>Hallowanderband</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;A Rhythm Game Woven with Story&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/9ede76df6946b410f2caa4c95d7204ac.poster.avif?t=1760692872\" width=1054 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/9ede76df6946b410f2caa4c95d7204ac.webm?t=1760692872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/9ede76df6946b410f2caa4c95d7204ac.mp4?t=1760692872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into two parts: the <strong>Episode Part</strong> and the <strong>Adventure Part</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Episode Part</strong>, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >challenge <strong>rhythm stages</strong> filled with animated storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Adventure Part</strong>, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >progress the story through <strong>dialogue</strong> and <strong>exploration</strong> to unlock new episodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Episodes in the Marching Band&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/478b81d15281f93fa8e55a87cfaeef31.poster.avif?t=1760692872\" width=1054 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/478b81d15281f93fa8e55a87cfaeef31.webm?t=1760692872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/478b81d15281f93fa8e55a87cfaeef31.mp4?t=1760692872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the <strong>left and right notes</strong> appearing on the <strong>round track</strong> in time with the rhythm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with simple <strong>two-key</strong> controls\u2014just one of the three keys on each side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy dynamic animations that react to your input, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and dive into each character\u2019s colorful <strong>episode</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Ta-Da!!!&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/3e289f85ed51a13ebdff76111589b22d.poster.avif?t=1760692872\" width=1054 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/3e289f85ed51a13ebdff76111589b22d.webm?t=1760692872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/3e289f85ed51a13ebdff76111589b22d.mp4?t=1760692872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the story reaches its peak, a sudden <strong>Ta-Da Event</strong>\u00a0appears!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This section uses all <strong>six keys</strong> on both sides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your reflexes and focus to overcome each episode\u2019s unique challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;What we need is, the background story!&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/be18a7d026e801d53721a9c5c1a1b47e.poster.avif?t=1760692872\" width=1054 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/be18a7d026e801d53721a9c5c1a1b47e.webm?t=1760692872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/be18a7d026e801d53721a9c5c1a1b47e.mp4?t=1760692872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>Adventure Part</strong>, the story unfolds through <strong>dialogue</strong> and <strong>exploration</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet charming <strong>Halloween friends</strong> along the way,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and join Ryoul in her journey to form the <strong>Hallowanderband</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3127030?t=1760692872","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760692872","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/ae6b56423bacf4d2af08acd9eccc12446cfb09b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760692872","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/ae6b56423bacf4d2af08acd9eccc12446cfb09b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760692872","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3127040,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/20700f430d9ff3236ca9d23b39923391.avif?t=1760692872\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Treat or Trick\u2b50&gt; </strong></h2><p